WEBVTT

00:02.750 --> 00:04.420
Prepare to fire!

00:04.420 --> 00:05.800
Fire!

00:09.800 --> 00:12.590
Attacking unarmed people without warning,

00:12.590 --> 00:14.850
is this really a country ruled by law?!

00:15.310 --> 00:20.100
We are going beyond the law to protect the public!

00:20.100 --> 00:23.440
Protecting the public, is it?

00:23.440 --> 00:25.320
You fools!

00:29.190 --> 00:33.990
Episode 12 :

00:29.190 --> 00:33.990
Showdown !Sound Robots V.S. Daimidaler

00:29.700 --> 00:31.360
Their mainframe's underground!

00:31.360 --> 00:33.740
Number 16 and 17, storm in!

00:35.620 --> 00:38.200
Number 16, entered the underground facility.

00:38.200 --> 00:41.040
Number 17, infiltrated as well. Sending video feed.

00:41.420 --> 00:45.540
The signal decay is too strong. Use Number 24 as a relay point!

00:45.540 --> 00:47.090
Looking for Tenants

00:47.460 --> 00:48.590
Prince is...

00:48.590 --> 00:50.260
They're going for the underground hangar.

00:50.260 --> 00:52.590
Shit! Did they get everyone?!

00:59.520 --> 01:00.890
Antenna?

01:05.230 --> 01:07.730
Number 24, wireless bridge complete.

01:07.730 --> 01:09.940
Monitors for Number 16 and Number 17 have recovered.

01:09.940 --> 01:11.360
There are no mobility issues.

01:12.070 --> 01:14.820
All right! The underground hangar is just one floor down!

01:30.210 --> 01:33.300
It looks like the Type-3 robots are all remotely controlled.

01:33.300 --> 01:34.970
Does that mean there's no pilot inside?

01:34.970 --> 01:37.100
Who cares about shit like that right now!

01:41.350 --> 01:42.180
Crap!

01:43.690 --> 01:45.100
We're surrounded!

01:46.230 --> 01:48.020
Oh, this is bad!

02:03.790 --> 02:05.330
Daimidaler!

02:05.330 --> 02:06.500
It's not here!

02:06.500 --> 02:08.880
Bastards! We were too late!

02:11.420 --> 02:13.380
But, who's piloting it?

02:14.170 --> 02:15.430
Yoo-hoo!

02:16.180 --> 02:17.430
Professor Sewashiko!

02:17.430 --> 02:20.180
Even we can give it simple commands.

02:20.430 --> 02:21.680
Professor Soriko?!

02:23.680 --> 02:25.520
Looks like we made it in the nick of time.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.770
Professor Moriko?!

02:27.100 --> 02:31.610
We moved them while the Administrator was arguing with the enemy.

02:32.070 --> 02:34.240
But this is the most we can do.

02:34.240 --> 02:35.950
Take care of the rest for us!

02:35.950 --> 02:38.280
Yeah! Leave it to us!

02:38.280 --> 02:39.620
Let's do it, Kyouko!

02:39.620 --> 02:40.450
Right.

02:41.330 --> 02:43.200
It's time to retaliate, Kouichi-kun.

02:47.750 --> 02:49.000
Shouma-kun.

02:50.040 --> 02:53.050
Shouma-kun, protect me.

02:54.210 --> 02:56.970
Kiriko-chan, I'm right here.

02:56.970 --> 02:58.470
Shouma-kun.

03:02.600 --> 03:03.720
Shouma-kun!

03:04.470 --> 03:06.480
If only they weren't like this.

03:06.690 --> 03:08.100
Let's go!

03:13.730 --> 03:15.860
You let Daimidaler escape?!

03:15.860 --> 03:17.070
C-Commander!

03:17.070 --> 03:18.240
What is it?

03:20.240 --> 03:21.490
Daimidaler!

03:21.490 --> 03:23.620
Double Punch!

03:31.210 --> 03:32.460
Type-6, Kiriko!

03:32.920 --> 03:34.460
Type-Super, Kouichi!

03:34.960 --> 03:37.470
Double Daimidaler has arrived!

03:38.050 --> 03:40.930
All units, take those two down no matter what!

03:42.350 --> 03:44.680
The Daimidalers are fighting each other.

03:44.680 --> 03:46.930
Shouma, what is the meaning of this?

03:46.930 --> 03:49.940
Ya, I don't really understand m'self.

03:50.310 --> 03:51.690
Internal fighting?

03:51.690 --> 03:55.940
It looks like the government of this country wants to eliminate Beauty Salon Prince.

03:55.940 --> 03:58.490
Finger Punch!

04:00.160 --> 04:01.160
Kiriko Kick!

04:03.160 --> 04:06.910
Unit 7, Unit 8, advance!

04:08.250 --> 04:12.420
Even Daimidaler won't be able to last long against such numbers.

04:13.790 --> 04:18.090
Um, Your Highness. What should we do in this situation?

04:18.970 --> 04:20.880
Should we try being happy about it?

04:22.260 --> 04:23.890
This is great, Dennis!

04:24.390 --> 04:26.010
You seem so happy, Jake!

04:27.600 --> 04:29.850
This doesn't feel right at all.

04:29.850 --> 04:32.310
Yeah. We're not really happy about it anyway.

04:36.110 --> 04:37.820
Ritz, where are you going?!

04:39.490 --> 04:41.820
We are the ones who will defeat Kouichi and Kiriko!

04:41.820 --> 04:44.820
Getting defeated by others, especially other humans!

04:46.080 --> 04:48.120
We won't allow it!

04:48.120 --> 04:50.580
Hey, Ritz!

04:52.330 --> 04:54.920
Shit. There's no end to them.

04:56.340 --> 04:58.510
Even if the power of Type-Super is limitless,

04:58.510 --> 05:01.220
there's a limit to Kouichi-kun's Hi-ERO particles.

05:02.050 --> 05:04.180
If we continue battling at this pace...

05:05.260 --> 05:07.600
We're going to lose?! Against people like this?

05:10.520 --> 05:11.230
What?

05:13.230 --> 05:14.150
A Penguin robot?

05:14.150 --> 05:16.520
Rikantz Seaberry?!

05:16.520 --> 05:18.230
Hello, everybody!

05:18.230 --> 05:20.240
I'm here too!

05:20.650 --> 05:21.650
Shouma-kun!

05:21.650 --> 05:23.150
Yahoo!

05:27.200 --> 05:29.660
Kiriko-chan, see ya later!

05:30.120 --> 05:31.660
Kiriko-chan is still okay!

05:31.660 --> 05:33.920
Okay, Shouma! Let's go!

05:35.540 --> 05:38.300
Cock-a-Doodle-Doo Attack!

05:41.840 --> 05:44.380
There's no need to evolt against small fry like this.

05:44.380 --> 05:46.010
What're you doing?

05:46.010 --> 05:47.390
Hmph. Don't take this the wrong way.

05:47.390 --> 05:50.850
Could it be that thing where you don't want a rival defeated by someone else or something?

05:52.140 --> 05:53.890
You should take it the wrong way at least a little bit!

05:53.890 --> 05:55.020
Which is it?!

05:55.020 --> 05:58.020
Shouma-kun! Change back to the Shouma-kun I know!

05:58.020 --> 06:00.780
Kiriko-chan, it's great being a Penguin!

06:00.780 --> 06:03.030
I have such a great front tail, too!

06:06.070 --> 06:07.490
This is terrible, Your Highness!

06:07.490 --> 06:08.740
Ritz is...!

06:08.740 --> 06:11.750
I know. She is fighting heroically.

06:11.750 --> 06:12.500
Huh?

06:13.160 --> 06:14.500
With whom?

06:15.170 --> 06:17.250
A robot from the Penguin Empire.

06:17.250 --> 06:20.750
Why? Why has the Penguin Empire appeared at a time like this?

06:20.750 --> 06:23.260
We can't act rashly against them!

06:23.260 --> 06:28.260
Destroying Beauty Salon Prince as a gift of peace to the Penguin Empire,

06:28.550 --> 06:31.260
that is the ultimate goal after all.

06:31.260 --> 06:33.770
Our country has a defense-oriented policy.

06:33.770 --> 06:36.770
We have no choice, but to fight back against any threat of tyranny.

06:37.150 --> 06:41.440
It's a good chance to show the Empire our country's true strength.

06:41.440 --> 06:43.690
We can negotiate with the Penguin Empire on better terms.

06:43.690 --> 06:45.820
Understood!

06:46.150 --> 06:49.160
We will treat the robot from
the Penguin Empire as an enemy as well.

06:49.160 --> 06:52.830
Daimidaler troops, shift to Double-X mode!

06:53.120 --> 06:55.330
But, we still...

06:55.540 --> 06:58.250
Isn't this the perfect chance to test it?

07:14.640 --> 07:15.890
They're retreating!

07:15.890 --> 07:18.440
Looks like they got scared of us and ran!

07:19.150 --> 07:19.940
No.

07:20.400 --> 07:22.820
Something is happening in that cloud.

07:30.570 --> 07:31.620
This is...?

07:32.030 --> 07:33.120
Evolt?!

07:38.620 --> 07:40.380
What the hell?

07:48.720 --> 07:52.600
We've also been researching robotics!

07:52.600 --> 07:55.970
And this is the result! The Double-X system!

07:56.430 --> 08:01.480
This is the true form of a sound robot. Super Sound!

08:14.830 --> 08:16.490
Super Sound.

08:16.750 --> 08:19.000
That thing's huge!

08:21.370 --> 08:23.630
Kiriko-chan, I'll fight together with ya.

08:23.880 --> 08:26.380
Shouma-kun, you've come back?

08:27.510 --> 08:28.590
That's right!

08:28.590 --> 08:31.550
Even if he looks like a Penguin, Shouma-kun is still Shouma-kun!

08:35.680 --> 08:38.390
The cockpit, it's so nostalgic!

08:39.680 --> 08:42.480
Shouma-kun, I'm sorry. I—

08:42.480 --> 08:44.900
Oops, my front tail got caught.

08:47.690 --> 08:52.950
It's a Penguin front tail, but not a
front tail, it's Shouma-kun's Gulliver...

08:52.950 --> 08:56.950
It's a Penguin front tail, but not a front tail,

08:56.950 --> 09:00.370
it's Shouma-kun's Gulliver!

09:00.830 --> 09:05.590
Commence attack! Targets, Daimidalers and Penguin!

09:06.460 --> 09:07.630
Goddamn!

09:08.760 --> 09:13.050
Penguin line one hundred percent! Release compression!

09:13.090 --> 09:15.340
Penguin Change!

09:15.390 --> 09:17.180
Let's do this! Kouichi! Kiriko!

09:17.180 --> 09:18.640
Don't order me around!

09:18.640 --> 09:20.770
Shouma-kun's Gulliver!

09:26.690 --> 09:28.360
You're too slow!

09:30.440 --> 09:32.150
You're all bark and no bite!

09:38.790 --> 09:40.830
Now that Shouma-kun is with me, I won't go berserk.

09:40.830 --> 09:42.200
Huh? Did you say something?

09:42.200 --> 09:44.710
No! Don't look this way!

09:45.040 --> 09:45.920
What's wrong?

09:45.920 --> 09:47.710
We're being pushed back!

09:48.210 --> 09:51.710
Due to damaged units, we were unable to recover before transformation.

09:51.710 --> 09:53.220
Can't you do something about that?!

09:53.680 --> 09:57.010
We're doing remote repairs. We need five more minutes...

09:57.010 --> 09:57.720
Five minutes, huh?

09:58.430 --> 10:00.720
Shit! It's so freaking tough!

10:00.720 --> 10:03.430
We should combine our power and focus it at a single point.

10:03.430 --> 10:05.060
We can tear it apart from that point!

10:05.350 --> 10:06.810
Nice idea!

10:06.810 --> 10:07.860
Is that okay, Kiriko-chan?

10:07.860 --> 10:08.980
Y-Yes!

10:08.980 --> 10:10.400
Let's do this!

10:10.440 --> 10:11.530
Here I go!

10:11.530 --> 10:13.150
Finger Punch!

10:11.530 --> 10:13.150
Disguise!

10:12.070 --> 10:13.150
Wait!

10:13.700 --> 10:15.990
This is a message for the Factors of Beauty Salon Prince.

10:16.530 --> 10:18.910
I am the commander of these troops.

10:18.910 --> 10:21.740
Put down your weapons and surrender!

10:21.740 --> 10:25.160
If you do that, I will guarantee your safety.

10:26.290 --> 10:29.170
Surrender? You're the one who attacked us!

10:29.170 --> 10:36.180
Beauty Salon Prince is a danger to the sound youth of society!

10:36.180 --> 10:38.680
We are just protecting them from that.

10:38.930 --> 10:41.680
Danger? Us?!

10:41.680 --> 10:46.190
Thanks to the Penguin Empire, the world was purified in an instant.

10:46.190 --> 10:47.650
What are you talking about?

10:47.650 --> 10:49.150
Oh, they're talking about that.

10:49.150 --> 10:52.860
You know, how we sucked up so many Hi-ERO particles from mankind.

10:52.860 --> 10:54.440
It makes humans lose their libido.

10:54.440 --> 10:55.650
Don't do such unnecessary things!

10:55.650 --> 10:57.950
But that's the goal of the Penguin Empire!

10:58.240 --> 11:02.450
And look what happened. Once Prince went back into action,

11:02.450 --> 11:06.460
immoral businesses and media made a comeback!

11:06.460 --> 11:11.880
And so, in order to protect the sound young men of this country, we have to make you all disappear!

11:11.880 --> 11:12.750
N-No way!

11:12.750 --> 11:14.960
What kind of reasoning is that?!

11:15.380 --> 11:16.970
Two more minutes to recovery.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.760
What in the world?

11:20.550 --> 11:25.310
Were we doing something so bad?

11:26.100 --> 11:27.810
Kiriko-chan.

11:28.190 --> 11:30.810
What's wrong with being perverted?!

11:31.440 --> 11:35.440
Being lovey-dovey with Shouma-kun is worth the death penalty?

11:35.440 --> 11:37.820
Bad enough that we have to disappear?

11:39.700 --> 11:40.820
I won't forgive them.

11:41.160 --> 11:43.530
Kiriko-chan. You okay?

11:43.530 --> 11:45.160
I cannot allow you to get involved.

11:45.160 --> 11:45.830
Huh?!

11:47.290 --> 11:48.330
Goodbye.

11:48.330 --> 11:49.460
You can't!

11:49.460 --> 11:51.830
I came here to protect ya, Kiriko-chan!

11:52.460 --> 11:57.380
Thank you. But, I'm going and taking the memories...

11:58.380 --> 12:00.130
...of a non-Penguin Shouma-kun with me.

12:00.640 --> 12:04.510
Kiriko-chan!

12:07.640 --> 12:08.890
Hey! The Type-6!

12:08.890 --> 12:11.400
She's planning on over-bursting and throwing herself at them!

12:11.400 --> 12:12.020
What?!

12:12.900 --> 12:14.440
Shouma-kun.

12:14.440 --> 12:17.900
I won't forgive anyone who refuses to acknowledge our deep love.

12:19.450 --> 12:20.990
Even if it means giving up my life!

12:24.780 --> 12:26.370
I will pummel them into the ground!

12:26.370 --> 12:28.000
You can't, Kiriko-chan!

12:26.370 --> 12:28.000
Stop it!

12:28.750 --> 12:29.830
Recovery complete!

12:39.380 --> 12:40.680
It can fly?!

12:40.680 --> 12:41.880
Even though it's so big?!

12:52.440 --> 12:53.480
Kiriko!

12:52.440 --> 12:53.480
Kiriko-chan!

12:55.190 --> 12:56.440
Oh, no!

13:02.860 --> 13:03.870
Shit!

13:03.870 --> 13:05.240
So powerful!

13:05.240 --> 13:07.620
We can't even get close at this rate!

13:09.500 --> 13:10.660
Bingo!

13:10.660 --> 13:12.960
It's that satellite antenna!

13:15.840 --> 13:19.340
Did they think we wouldn't notice the wireless device?

13:20.550 --> 13:23.090
We'll give them a chance to win.

13:29.890 --> 13:32.730
No one can beat the Super Sound at full power!

13:34.650 --> 13:36.270
Preparations complete!

13:36.270 --> 13:37.570
Do it!

13:37.770 --> 13:38.570
Fire!

13:42.070 --> 13:43.150
All right!

13:51.580 --> 13:52.540
Signal lost!

13:52.540 --> 13:53.660
What did you say?!

13:59.000 --> 14:01.260
Controlling Super Sound now is impossible!

14:04.180 --> 14:05.890
R-Retreat!

14:07.680 --> 14:09.510
It's going berserk!

14:09.510 --> 14:10.600
Did it go crazy?

14:10.600 --> 14:11.470
Where is Kiriko?

14:11.930 --> 14:14.100
I've been calling her, but...

14:17.360 --> 14:18.820
Kiriko-chan.

14:18.820 --> 14:19.730
Kiriko-chan!

14:22.230 --> 14:23.740
Thank goodness.

14:24.740 --> 14:26.910
Shouma-kun?

14:26.910 --> 14:28.240
Yeah. It's me.

14:28.240 --> 14:32.660
Shouma-kun! It really is you, Shouma-kun!

14:32.660 --> 14:34.750
But, how?

14:35.370 --> 14:36.370
Well...

14:36.540 --> 14:38.880
After I was ejected from Type-6...

14:44.380 --> 14:46.380
Thank you. You are?

14:46.720 --> 14:50.890
I'm Henry. I'm also called Number Six.

14:50.890 --> 14:52.510
Number Sex?

14:54.310 --> 14:55.890
What are you doing?

14:55.890 --> 14:58.350
It's an order from the Emperor.

14:58.350 --> 15:00.860
I'm going to infuse Hi-ERO particles into you!

15:07.410 --> 15:09.780
With this, my job is done.

15:10.990 --> 15:12.910
Oh! I'm back to normal.

15:12.910 --> 15:14.910
Tell Kyouko-san that I said hello.

15:17.370 --> 15:19.130
A Penguin Commando helped you?

15:19.130 --> 15:20.840
I'm sorry for making you worry.

15:20.840 --> 15:23.380
Now, let's fight together, Kiriko-chan!

15:23.380 --> 15:25.420
All right, Shouma-kun!

15:29.720 --> 15:30.970
At this rate...

15:32.680 --> 15:34.970
Tokyo will become a wasteland!

15:37.480 --> 15:39.270
Its armor is too thick!

15:39.480 --> 15:41.400
Shit! We can't even scratch it!

15:41.650 --> 15:43.860
Our best bet is a concentrated attack after all!

15:43.860 --> 15:46.610
We'll have to use Finger Beam and Penguin Thrust at the same time!

15:46.610 --> 15:48.030
I'm coming too!

15:48.610 --> 15:51.030
Kiriko-chan! But, you...

15:51.320 --> 15:53.410
I'm all right. I won't go berserk.

15:53.830 --> 15:55.160
I wouldn't allow it!

15:55.160 --> 15:56.870
Ameku Shouma-kun?!

15:56.870 --> 15:58.710
Weren't you a Penguin until a second ago?

15:59.080 --> 16:01.500
A Penguin named Henry changed me back.

16:01.790 --> 16:04.000
He told me to give you his regards, Kyouko-san.

16:04.000 --> 16:05.420
To me?

16:07.340 --> 16:08.300
It couldn't be!

16:09.930 --> 16:11.220
What's wrong, Kyouko?

16:12.010 --> 16:14.930
No, it's nothing.

16:19.640 --> 16:22.060
Kouichi-kun, this is a decisive battle!

16:22.360 --> 16:26.280
So, um, you can fondle me all you want.

16:26.280 --> 16:32.280
Yeah, Kyouko! I'll fondle! And fondle! And fondle them to death!

16:36.790 --> 16:40.290
Shouma-kun, mess me up even more!

16:40.750 --> 16:43.540
Yeah. I won't hold back today, Kiriko-chan.

16:44.210 --> 16:45.170
Shouma-kun.

16:54.850 --> 16:57.600
Why are we the only ones to taste bitter loneliness?

17:00.640 --> 17:01.600
Let's do this!

17:00.640 --> 17:01.600
Here we go!

17:01.600 --> 17:02.230
Yes!

17:02.230 --> 17:03.520
Okay!

17:04.730 --> 17:06.270
How lewd!

17:06.480 --> 17:09.740
We're going to be saved by such immoral people?

17:09.740 --> 17:10.820
You fool.

17:11.700 --> 17:14.740
Matayoshi Kazuo! So you were alive!

17:14.740 --> 17:16.950
I won't die from something like that.

17:17.660 --> 17:21.250
I ask you this! What is the meaning of being sound?!

17:21.250 --> 17:24.130
Don't make me repeat myself.

17:22.960 --> 17:27.040
Complete! Daimidaler Type-6, Kiriko! Disguise!

17:24.130 --> 17:26.340
It is the proper growth of sound youth!

17:26.340 --> 17:28.090
Don't make me laugh!

17:27.040 --> 17:28.630
Kiriko-chan, let's do this!

17:28.090 --> 17:29.550
I won't let you say I'm wrong!

17:28.630 --> 17:29.550
Yes!

17:29.550 --> 17:34.550
Daimidaler CP Slash!

17:29.880 --> 17:34.550
You, no, all of you were born from perverted actions!

17:34.550 --> 17:34.930
What?!

17:34.930 --> 17:38.890
Didn't you bastards enjoy your perverted youth and gain wisdom through the years?

17:36.220 --> 17:40.140
Fiery Blast! Penguin Thrust!

17:38.890 --> 17:43.940
However, you hide it from the ears and eyes of the current youth!

17:42.440 --> 17:45.230
Finger Beam!

17:43.940 --> 17:48.690
You hypocrites! If you go that far, show me a way to make children without lust!

17:48.690 --> 17:50.940
Date your lover without a single perverted action!

17:51.320 --> 17:52.820
Let's do this, Kiriko-san!

17:52.820 --> 17:53.700
Roger!

17:54.240 --> 17:56.450
Gather Daimidaler!

17:59.160 --> 18:04.750
Daimidaler Insert Break!

18:04.750 --> 18:08.380
To begin with, love is just another cultural description of lust!

18:08.380 --> 18:12.920
Proper growth of perversion is the perfect way to foster love!

18:12.920 --> 18:13.840
Listen up!

18:14.340 --> 18:17.390
Real criminals put themselves on a pedestal

18:17.390 --> 18:19.180
and push their own ideals onto others,

18:19.180 --> 18:21.930
like you unsound bastards!

18:21.930 --> 18:23.850
You unsound middle-aged assholes!

18:24.600 --> 18:27.100
All right!

18:30.480 --> 18:37.740
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

18:30.480 --> 18:37.740
unaru ribidou  chikara ni kaerou

18:37.320 --> 18:39.120
Good work, everyone.

18:37.990 --> 18:45.210
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

18:37.990 --> 18:45.210
Kenzen Robo Daimidaraa

18:39.120 --> 18:42.040
It looks like we won, Shouma-kun.

18:42.040 --> 18:44.870
Yeah. We won, Kiriko-chan.

18:44.870 --> 18:48.580
Well, looks like we took care of this little problem.

18:52.590 --> 18:53.460
What?

18:53.840 --> 18:56.550
Your power was a great help.

18:56.550 --> 18:58.680
Thank you, Rikantz Seaberry.

18:56.880 --> 19:03.810
The darkness is spreading

18:56.880 --> 19:03.810
hirogari yuku yami no kyoui

18:58.680 --> 19:04.430
H-Hmph. If you are thanking us, you should call us Ritz, cutely.

